  "notes": "でかい is a casual/emphatic version of ⟦{大|おお}きい→大きい：00335_ookii⟧. It may come from the Kanto dialect or from {凸|でこ} (protrusion).\n\nREGISTER:\nThis is casual/colloquial language. Use ⟦{大|おお}きい→大きい：00335_ookii⟧ in polite or formal contexts.\n\nAs an i-adjective: でかく⟦ない→ない：01118_nai⟧ (negative), でかかった (past), でかく (adverb form).\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- でかい⟦{態度|たいど}→態度：03396_taido⟧: arrogant attitude (lit. \"big attitude\")\n- でかい⟦{顔|かお}→顔：00558_kao⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to act big/arrogant\n- でかすぎ: way too big",
